  "id": "one-pan-chicken-and-chorizo-rice",
  "name": "One-Pan Chicken and Chorizo Rice",
  "subtitle": "A savory skillet meal with tender chicken, spiced rice, peas, and parsley.",
  "description": "Chorizo, chicken, aromatics, and seasoned rice cook together in one pan, finished with peas, parsley, and garlic mayonnaise.",
